# Testing Rules

- Use the lowest-cost test that proves the behavior; add broader tests when risk requires.
- Critical paths must have deterministic automated coverage.
- Do not weaken or delete tests to make CI pass.
- Run `pytest -q` from `ERP-BACKEND/` (expects 49 passed, 1 PG-only skip).
- Alembic migrations: single head, `alembic upgrade head` applies cleanly on fresh DB.
- Frontend build must succeed: `npm ci && npm run build`.
- Qualification gate: `scripts/setup.sh --qualify` must pass.
